No utilizar:

- Firebase.
- Firebase Authentication.
- Firestore.
- Firebase Hosting.
- Google Cloud.
- Cloud Run.
- Cloud Functions.
- WhatsApp Business API.
- Secret Manager.
- Servicios que exijan tarjeta de crédito.
